    "user_request_original": "Design a 21-layer HfO2/SiO2 defect-cavity filter on fused silica substrate with air incident medium. Stack sequence: HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2(cavity)|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2. Initialize optimization from three candidate thickness sets: candidate A [250.6, 306.5, 256.0, 300.9, 269.6, 278.7, 239.9, 252.1, 231.9, 290.2, 382.8, 252.6, 223.5, 252.2, 327.5, 235.6, 255.1, 324.4, 300.3, 253.3, 229.1] nm, candidate B [251.0, 336.4, 257.0, 332.3, 272.2, 284.3, 325.0, 266.3, 305.3, 263.6, 382.1, 269.8, 247.9, 285.2, 315.0, 248.1, 245.0, 277.8, 240.9, 263.8, 255.9] nm, candidate C [334.9, 266.1, 224.5, 253.9, 325.4, 247.8, 234.8, 315.2, 244.8, 263.9, 381.3, 243.2, 265.8, 280.5, 281.2, 322.1, 259.2, 283.0, 255.5, 327.4, 283.8] nm. Apply deterministic perturbation grid to layer 10 (cavity): test thicknesses at [375.5, 379.5, 381.5, 383.5, 387.5] nm. Constrain L-BFGS-B optimizer step sizes for layers 0-9 and 11-20 to maximum 20% of their current thickness values per iteration. Evaluate at normal incidence, unpolarized or both TE/TM. Optimize for high transmittance in 1530-1565nm band and high reflectance in 400-700nm band. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers.",
    "normalized_request_english": "Optimize a 21-layer HfO2/SiO2 defect-cavity filter on fused silica under normal incidence, targeting high transmittance in 1530-1565 nm and high reflectance in 400-700 nm. Include a baseline scan varying cavity thickness to assess sensitivity.",
